+## Session initialization failure
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, `onError` receives the session and that error, then `afterSession` receives the session, and the same error reaches the caller. Cleanup must allow for `beforeSession` to have failed before completing and for no user input or model processing to have occurred ([validated by: reports the error and runs cleanup before rejecting when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L8)).
+
 ## Measured semantics — out of scope
 
-These three properties of `src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts` are recorded so the hook features that follow specify against real behaviour. This issue changes none of them; each is a separate, out-of-scope change owned by no issue in this epic.
